# SELECT held: a page's other knobs. The arp on the Bells page (ARP), Notes on the Pad's (ENV) and the Bass's (LFO);
# each with the piece, gone with the recipe. A project from the slate's build (format 5) keeps its settings.
wait 300
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 2
expect par36 0
press SEL
wait 100
shot arp_off.png
spin K1 1
expect par36 1
spin K1 5
expect par36 6
spin K2 1
expect par37 3
spin K3 -1
expect par38 1
wait 100
shot arp.png
spin K4 2
expect par41 2
shot poly.png
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 2
spin K2 2
expect par36 6
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 1
press SEL
wait 100
expect par39 4
spin K2 -1
expect par39 3
shot pad_notes.png
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 1
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 3
press SEL
wait 100
expect par40 0
shot bass_held.png
spin K2 30
wait 100
shot bass_notes.png
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 3
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par36 6
expect par37 3
expect par38 1
expect par39 3
expect par41 2
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par36 0
expect par37 2
expect par38 2
expect par39 4
expect par40 0
expect par41 0
# from the slate's build
turn PRESET 3
storev5 44
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 3
expect par0 44
expect par36 0
expect par39 4
expect par40 0
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 44
